local das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias: 26 km com cerca de 2000m D+ (tempo limite de 6 horas e corte ao km 12 \u00e0s 3 horas), 16 km com 1100m D+ (tempo limite de 4 horas) e 12 km com 800m D+ (tempo limite de 4 horas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Sky Race Montejunto Inverno 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a 15 de novembro de 2026 e dividem-se em tr\u00eas fases: at\u00e9 30 de setembro (22 \u20ac nos 26 km, 12 \u20ac nos 16 km e 10 \u20ac nos 12 km), de 1 a 31 de outubro (26 \u20ac nos 26 km, 16 \u20ac nos 16 km e 12 \u20ac nos 12 km) e de 1 a 15 de novembro (28 \u20ac nos 26 km, 18 \u20ac nos 16 km e 14 \u20ac nos 12 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes devem transportar manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional, copo m\u00ednimo de 15 cl, imperme\u00e1vel com capuz e reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo de 1,0 litro para os 26 km e 0,5 litro para os 16 km e 12 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Sky Race Montejunto Inverno 2026 e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Turres Trail Clube sob a tutela da FCMP e com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal do Cadaval. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, seguro, abastecimentos, medalha finisher, refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira ap\u00f3s a prova e banhos no Parque de Campismo de Montejunto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Sky Race Montejunto Inverno 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro de Interpreta\u00e7\u00e3o Ambiental da Serra de Montejunto, Montejunto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Cadaval\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Turres Trail Clube\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Sky Race Montejunto Inverno 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Sky Race Montejunto Inverno 2026 realiza-se no dia 22 de novembro de 2026 (domingo), com partida \u00e0s 10:00 no Centro de Interpreta\u00e7\u00e3o Ambiental da Serra de Montejunto. O secretariado funciona no local das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias: 26 km com cerca de 2000m D+ (tempo limite de 6 horas e corte ao km 12 \u00e0s 3 horas), 16 km com 1100m D+ (tempo limite de 4 horas) e 12 km com 800m D+ (tempo limite de 4 horas).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Sky Race Montejunto Inverno 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a 15 de novembro de 2026 e dividem-se em tr\u00eas fases: at\u00e9 30 de setembro (22 \u20ac nos 26 km, 12 \u20ac nos 16 km e 10 \u20ac nos 12 km), de 1 a 31 de outubro (26 \u20ac nos 26 km, 16 \u20ac nos 16 km e 12 \u20ac nos 12 km) e de 1 a 15 de novembro (28 \u20ac nos 26 km, 18 \u20ac nos 16 km e 14 \u20ac nos 12 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os participantes devem transportar manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional, copo m\u00ednimo de 15 cl, imperme\u00e1vel com capuz e reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo de 1,0 litro para os 26 km e 0,5 litro para os 16 km e 12 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o Sky Race Montejunto Inverno 2026 e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Turres Trail Clube sob a tutela da FCMP e com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal do Cadaval. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, seguro, abastecimentos, medalha finisher, refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira ap\u00f3s a prova e banhos no Parque de Campismo de Montejunto.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70258,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[708,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-54919","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-cadaval-lisboa","event_type-skyrunning","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/sky-race-montejunto-inverno-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54919","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=54919"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54919\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70173,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54919\/revisions\/70173"}],"wp:featuredmedia